      <description><![CDATA[<b>Species:</b> BKT, BNT, RBT &mdash; <b>B1</b><br/><b>Watershed:</b> Dog River<br/>Managed as rainbow spawning water; closed to fishing until June 1 under special regs (verify current regs). Not the Fayston Chase Brook.<br/><b>Nearest access:</b><ul><li>Dog River Jacuzzi Natural Area - Berlin VFD lot (2095 VT-12) &mdash; 691 m as the crow flies, 39.2 min drive</li></ul><br/><b>Drive from inn:</b> 40.9 min<br/><b>Source:</b> <a href="https://dec.vermont.gov/sites/dec/files/wsm/mapp/docs/mp_UpperWinooskiWatershedFisheriesSummary_2017-12-15.pdf#page=7">VFWD 2017, Table 10 p.7</a><br/><b>Confidence:</b> high (VFWD 2017 Table 10)]]></description>
