    <name>Access and parking</name>
    <Placemark>
      <name>Lincoln Gap - Long Trail trailhead</name>
      <description><![CDATA[<b>Type:</b> trailhead<br/><b>Parking:</b> Small lots at the top of Lincoln Gap Rd; fill on fall weekends. Pull-offs on the way up on the Warren side give brook access. Road unpaved near the top and closed in winter.<br/>Lincoln Brook starts just below the gap and follows the road down to Warren village. Long Trail north to Mt Abraham, Sunset Ledge spur.<br/><b>Drive from inn:</b> 23.2 min<br/><b>Source:</b> Google Places; general knowledge (seasonal closure)<br/><b>Confidence:</b> high (GP)]]></description>
