    <Placemark>
      <name>Phen Basin Trailhead (Battleground Rd, Fayston)</name>
      <description><![CDATA[<b>Type:</b> trailhead<br/><b>Parking:</b> Park in the signed visitor parking just before the covered bridge at the Battleground (off Rte 17), parallel to the road; do not drive over the bridge.<br/>Trail climbs about 2 miles up an old logging road beside a small cascading brook that drains to Mill Brook (verify the brook's name against the hydrography layer).<br/><b>Drive from inn:</b> 13.4 min<br/><b>Source:</b> Google Places (reviews describe parking and trail)<br/><b>Confidence:</b> high (GP)]]></description>
