    <Placemark>
      <name>Mad River Path - Millbrook Trailhead (Harris Hill Rd)</name>
      <description><![CDATA[<b>Type:</b> trailhead<br/><b>Parking:</b> NO PARKING at the trailhead itself (signed). Park across from Fayston Elementary School on German Flats Rd and walk in.<br/>Mill Brook Trail: 1.5 mi with a 200-ft bridge over Mill Brook, co-located with the Catamount Trail through Chase Brook Town Forest toward the Battleground. Serves both the Mill Brook and Chase Brook (Fayston) B1 points.<br/><b>Drive from inn:</b> 11.2 min<br/><b>Source:</b> https://madriverpath.org/maps ; https://www.madriverpath.org/news ; Google Places reviews<br/><b>Confidence:</b> high (GP)]]></description>
