    <Placemark>
      <name>Blueberry Lake Trails parking (1825 Plunkton Rd, East Warren)</name>
      <description><![CDATA[<b>Type:</b> parking<br/><b>Parking:</b> USFS lot on the east side of Plunkton Rd; trailheads across the road. From Warren Main St: Brook Rd 1.9 mi, right on Plunkton Rd 1.8 mi.<br/>Closest USFS lot to the inn (about 10 min). The lake's dam is on Mills Brook; the lake is stocked with brook trout (report p.8). Gentle multi-use trail loops.<br/><b>Drive from inn:</b> 16.6 min<br/><b>Source:</b> https://www.trailfinder.info/trails/trail/blueberry-lake-gmnf ; https://www.madriverriders.org/trails.html ; https://birdinghotspots.org/hotspot/L751883<br/><b>Confidence:</b> high (GP)]]></description>
