    <Placemark>
      <name>Austin Brook Trail / Forest Road 25 gate</name>
      <description><![CDATA[<b>Type:</b> trailhead<br/><b>Parking:</b> USFS gate at the start of unplowed FR 25; roadside parking. Find the gate off Rte 100 south of Warren — verify on the USFS page.<br/>The trail follows FR 25 about 2 miles up along Austin Brook through mixed forest.<br/><b>Drive from inn:</b> 19.8 min<br/><b>Source:</b> https://www.fs.usda.gov/recarea/gmfl/recreation/recarea/?recid=83040&amp;actid=91<br/><b>Confidence:</b> low (geocoded 2026-09-24: Austin Brook VHD line, downstream end (mouth at Rte 100) - FR 25 gate not in OSM, verify on site)]]></description>
