    <Placemark>
      <name>The Silver Trout (fly shop)</name>
      <description><![CDATA[<b>Category:</b> fly shop<br/>40 Bridge St, Unit 4 (upstairs), Waitsfield. Fri-Sat 10-4, Sun 10-3, or by appointment 802-496-3110. Flies and current local advice.<br/><b>Drive from inn:</b> 3.7 min<br/><b>Source:</b> https://thesilvertrout.com/fly-fishing-shop<br/><b>Confidence:</b> high (Google Places 2026-09-23)]]></description>
