    <Placemark>
      <name>Blueberry Lake (stocked brook trout)</name>
      <description><![CDATA[<b>Category:</b> lake<br/>48-acre USFS lake on Plunkton Rd, East Warren: stocked brook trout plus largemouth, bluegill, bullhead (report p.8). Swimming, kayaking, easy trail loops. Move the pin onto the lake; the lot is across the road.<br/><b>Drive from inn:</b> 16.6 min<br/><b>Source:</b> VFWD 2017 p.8; https://www.fs.usda.gov/r09/gmfl/recreation/trails/blueberry-lake-trails<br/><b>Confidence:</b> medium (Google Places (parking lot) 2026-09-24)]]></description>
